nd fractions, and a full exponent sweep from `2^-1080` to `2^1023`. Output was **byte-identical** (`cmp` clean).\n\nI did not modify anything in `c_src/`, and no behavior was \"fixed\" — the semantics are reproduced as written."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_read_input_tokens":24627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":659,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2939a37-4b29-46b6-9325-d29ba4bda26e","uuid":"c7e949c5-2722-42b4-953f-9592760ad725","timestamp":"2026-08-17T21:13:32.983Z"}
